# ===================================================
# MENIKMATI SATU TABEL MYSQL (program_kerja)
# HANYA PROGRAM KERJA & KELOLA KEGIATAN OSIS
# ===================================================

### -------------------------------------------------
### 1. MENU PROGRAM KERJA (is_event = 0, Read-Only / Internal OSIS)
### -------------------------------------------------

### Lihat Semua Program Kerja OSIS
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/program-kerja
Accept: application/json

###

### Tambah Program Kerja OSIS Baru (Pengurus OSIS)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/program-kerja
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
    "nama_proker": "Pentas Seni Budaya",
    "divisi": "Sekbid Kesenian",
    "target": "2026-10-25"
}

###

### Detail Program Kerja Berdasarkan ID
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/program-kerja/1
Accept: application/json

###

### Perbarui Program Kerja OSIS
PUT http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/program-kerja/1
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
    "nama_proker": "Pentas Seni & Bazar Budaya",
    "divisi": "Sekbid Kesenian",
    "target": "2026-11-01"
}

###

### Hapus Program Kerja
DELETE http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/program-kerja/1
Accept: application/json

###


### -------------------------------------------------
### 2. MENU KELOLA KEGIATAN OSIS (is_event = 1, Agenda Acara)
### -------------------------------------------------

### Lihat Semua Agenda Kegiatan OSIS
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/events
Accept: application/json

###

### Tambah Kegiatan / Event Baru (Form Kelola Kegiatan UI)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/events
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
    "nama_event": "PPKM",
    "tanggal": "2026-10-15",
    "deskripsi": "Pekan Pelatihan Kreativitas Murid",
    "status": "Mendatang"
}

###

### Detail Agenda Kegiatan Berdasarkan ID
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/events/1
Accept: application/json

###

### Perbarui Agenda Kegiatan OSIS
PUT http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/events/1
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
    "nama_event": "PPKM (Pekan Pelatihan Kreativitas Murid)",
    "tanggal": "2026-10-18",
    "deskripsi": "Pekan Pelatihan Kreativitas Murid Terbuka",
    "status": "Berlangsung"
}

###

### Hapus Agenda Kegiatan OSIS
DELETE http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/events/1
Accept: application/json
